  ~ flag remnant_trusted
  ~ reputation remnant += 20
  ~ chronicle "Preservation Mission"
    Accepted a preservation mission for the Remnant. Human artifacts to Verity Archives.
  -> END

* [Decline]
  ~ chronicle "Remnant Request"
    Declined a preservation mission for the Remnant.
  -> END

=== details

"Personal effects. Photographs, jewelry, a child's toy. Objects 
the makers held. Objects that remember their touch."

The curator's signal wavers—something like grief in the modulation.

"We cannot restore them. But we can preserve what they left behind."

* [Accept the mission]
  ~ flag remnant_trusted
  ~ flag human_artifact_found
  ~ reputation remnant += 20
  ~ integrity += 5
  ~ chronicle "Preservation Mission"
    Accepted a preservation mission for the Remnant. Carrying objects the makers touched.
  -> END

* [Decline gently]
  ~ damage integrity 3
  ~ chronicle "Remnant Request"
    Heard a Remnant curator's plea. Couldn't commit.
  -> END
